00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.320 align:start position:19%
The librarians were not just collectors.
They were inventors.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:12.440 align:start position:19%
Callimachus of Cyrene builds the
Pinakes, the first library catalog in

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:16.360 align:start position:19%
history, 120 volumes listing every
author and every work, each with a short

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:20.360 align:start position:19%
biography.
It is the ancestor of every search

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:25.080 align:start position:19%
engine you have ever used.
When you type into Google, you are using

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:29.200 align:start position:19%
an idea born on these steps.
Then comes Eratosthenes, the head

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:34.520 align:start position:19%
